# Authors of Núcleo

Sergio Iván Ullaguari Alvarado <security@nucleoledger.com>

This is the author of every commit in the repository's history. There is no
other author.

Since 2026-10-02 the author commits and signs the release tags as the identity
above. Commits made before 2026-10-02 (from 2026-09-03 to 2026-09-28) record the
same person under the short name "Sergio U" and a different, personal e-mail
address. The history is left as it is: rewriting it would change every commit
hash after the first one, including those named by the published release tags.

Most commits also carry a `Co-Authored-By:` trailer naming an AI model (Claude,
by Anthropic), which the author used to write code and documentation. This file
records that fact as it appears in the history; it does not state what it means
for authorship or ownership.
